Package: ropas
Title: R Client for the OPAS ISPRA Air Quality Web Service
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Giovanni", "Bonafe", , "giovanni.bonafe@arpa.fvg.it",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7815-8866"))
Description: Provides an R interface to the OPAS (OPen Air System) REST API
    exposed by ISPRA (Istituto Superiore per la Protezione e la Ricerca
    Ambientale). Functions cover authentication (JWT login and token
    refresh), retrieval of the national air quality monitoring network
    catalogue (stations, parameters, data series), and download of
    hourly and daily time series measurements with validity codes.
